    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like just being flawed. it feels like my existence is literally costing them something. my wife is constantly exhausted, my kids look at me like they're walking on eggshells... i see the toll it takes. it feels like the only selfless thing left for me to do is to just stop being a problem for them. to just let them breathe again.",
