    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, therapy just feels like more work for everyone. more time they have to spend worrying about me, more money, more energy... it just keeps the cycle going. i look at them and i realize that if i wasn't around, they could finally just focus on being happy. they wouldn't have to worry about me falling apart anymore. isn't it kinder to just let them go and be free of me?",
